# Casa de descanso (C5b, contract 48), 9 x 7, interior. column = i, row = j. A rest house of the Reserva Salvaje (Reserva Salvaje rest houses: a place to sit and a hint): two visitors (the old man's teeth are in area 3;
# Lambalm and the bait), a shelf of books on the habits of Elementis, a bed and a table. Wooden floor.
@map casa_descanso_1
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  e  object=bed
  f  object=bookshelf text=rest.books interact=look
  h  object=table
  i  npc=explorador id=v1 face=SE text=rest.a
  l  npc=chica id=v2 face=W text=rest.b
  j  object=candle_s
  k  tile=mat
@grid
  abbcbbcbb
  de.f...f.
  de.......
  d..h.i...
  d.j...l..
  d........
  d...kk...
@warp k -> reserva_2 spawn=rest_door
